$DATUM 2.2.2. 2,6-Di(bromomethyl)-3,5-bis(dodecyloxy
carbonyl)-4-phenyl-1,4-dihydropyridine (5): To a solution of compound 4
(3.03 g, 5.00 mmol) in methanol NBS (1.85 g, 10.40 mmol) was added
portionwise. The reaction mixture was stirred at rt for 20 h. The yellow
precipitate was filtered off, and washed with water. The precipitate was
crystallised from ethanol. 5. Yield yellow powder, (2.76 g, 72%). 1H NMR
spectrum (CDCl3, 200 MHz): δ 0.88 (t, 6H, J=6.6), 1.21-1.33 (m, 36H),
1.61-1.67 (m, 4H), 4.00 (t, 4H, J=6.6), 4.62 and 4.91 (AB-system, 4H,
J=11.4), 5.02 (s, 1H), 6.57 (br s, 1H), 7.17-7.30 (m, 5H); 13C NMR
spectrum (CDCl3, 100 MHz): δ 14.09; 22.66; 26.02; 27.32; 28.55; 29.26;
29.34; 29.53; 29.59; 29.62; 29.65; 31.90; 40.07; 64.77; 106.07; 126.84;
127.91; 128.21; 141.60; 145.60; 166.20; IR (film): 3320, 1696, 1676 cm-1;
Anal. Calcd. for C39H61Br2NO4: C, 61.02; H, 8.01; N, 1.82. Found: C,
61.23; H, 8.04; N, 1.73; mp: 87-90°C.
